Grow the command window's rasp past 1<<20 runes, then scroll, so the scrollbar's
position arithmetic takes its large-file scaled path (scrpos: tot/p0/p1 >>= 10).

-- input --
growdata 0 0 hi\n
grow 0 0 1100000
origin 0 10
